# =============================================================
# What IS committed:
#   code/          — engine modules, CLI scripts and maintenance tools
#   docs/          — current manuscript drafts, variables.json and planning documents
#   CLAUDE.md      — project constitution
#   meta.md        — living decisions log
#   README.md      — project overview
#   .gitignore     — this file
#   Theory/        — versioned thesis and implementation specification
#   tests/         — verification scripts
#
# What is NOT committed:
#   data/raw/      — raw calibration data (document provenance in README instead)
#   data/processed/— regenerable from pipeline
#   output/        — regenerable from pipeline (commit milestone snapshots manually)
# =============================================================

experiments/phase1_5_encoding_validity/profile_ablation_*/records/
experiments/phase1_5_encoding_validity/profile_ablation_*/dispatches/

experiments/phase1_5_encoding_validity/pd_interaction_*/records/
experiments/phase1_5_encoding_validity/pd_interaction_*/dispatches/

experiments/phase1_5_encoding_validity/joint_wording_*/records/
experiments/phase1_5_encoding_validity/joint_wording_*/dispatches/

